  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra l&#xe5;ngsikti kreditv&#xe4;rdighet f&#xf6;r Veliky Novgorod och dess tre kommunala tj&#xe4;nstebolag. Konsultinsatsen inkluderar f&#xf6;ljande omr&#xe5;den: Finansiell mgmt, demand mgmt, kundtj&#xe4;nst,  information, milj&#xf6;policy, j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, st&#xf6;d till Corporate  Development Plans, samt investeringsm&#xf6;jliheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to enhance the long-term creditworthiness of Veliky Novgorod City and its utilities. The consulting services include the following areas: Financial Management, Demand Management, Customer Relations and Services, Information Management, Environmental Policy, Gender Equality, Support and monitoring of CDP and Immediate Investment Opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
